{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "id": "room-read-off-the-exchange",
  "title": {
    "en": "Room read off the exchange",
    "zh": "从交换读出的余地"
  },
  "kind": "theorem",
  "status": "recorded-checked",
  "family": "F04",
  "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-10-25T17:35:57+00:00",
  "statement": {
    "en": "Over one step of exchange, where a part's members take at most their capacity and give at most what they take, room holds; every optimum of every order rising with what couples in stands beyond at what the rest leaves less the part's capacity, lowering a condition just where the part has capacity.",
    "zh": "一步交换中，部分的成员至多取其容量、所给不多于所取时，余地成立；每个随耦合入者升高的序的最优，在之外立于其余者所留减去容量处，部分无可取处不动。"
  },
  "laws": [
    {
      "en": "The outcomes open to a part across one step are the levels after every balanced step in which the formations outside the part exchange as they do and each member takes from each condition at most its capacity, gives only to the listed conditions and gives them no more than it takes from them; the step that happened is one, and what such a step takes from a condition is what the rest takes with at most the capacity.",
      "zh": "部分跨一步可达的结果：凡部分之外的构成照常交换、每个成员从每个条件至多取其容量、只给所列条件且所给不多于所取的平衡步之后的水平；发生的那一步即其一；这样的步从一个条件所取，是其余者所取加至多容量。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Flow.restTaken",
        "Becoming.Flow.restGiven",
        "Becoming.Flow.capacity",
        "Becoming.Flow.ActsWithin",
        "Becoming.Flow.Outcome",
        "Becoming.Flow.Outcome.of_balances",
        "Becoming.Flow.capacity_eq_zero",
        "Becoming.Flow.ActsWithin.taken_eq",
        "Becoming.Flow.ActsWithin.given_eq",
        "Becoming.Flow.ActsWithin.part_taken_le",
        "Becoming.Flow.other_of_out",
        "Becoming.total_split"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "A member with capacity to spare at a condition can take one more unit there and give it to a condition of the family, and a member giving a unit at a condition can give it to the family instead; either step stays within the part's capacity and balances into the transfer of one unit from that condition into the family.",
      "zh": "在某条件上容量有余的成员可在那里多取一个单位并给予族中某个条件；在某条件上给出一个单位的成员可改给族；两种步都在部分的容量之内，并平衡成把一个单位从该条件移入族。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.total_raise_at",
        "Becoming.Flow.moveUnit",
        "Becoming.Flow.redirect",
        "Becoming.Flow.moveUnit_take",
        "Becoming.Flow.moveUnit_give",
        "Becoming.Flow.redirect_give",
        "Becoming.Flow.moveUnit_taken_at",
        "Becoming.Flow.moveUnit_taken_off",
        "Becoming.Flow.moveUnit_given_at",
        "Becoming.Flow.moveUnit_given_off",
        "Becoming.Flow.redirect_given_at",
        "Becoming.Flow.redirect_given_to",
        "Becoming.Flow.redirect_given_off",
        "Becoming.Flow.moveUnit_balances",
        "Becoming.Flow.redirect_balances",
        "Becoming.Flow.ActsWithin.moveUnit",
        "Becoming.Flow.ActsWithin.redirect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Among the outcomes open to a part above any floors beyond, an outcome above another at a condition beyond is exceeded on the family by an outcome open to the part: under the other step some member takes more there or gives less there, and this step can move or redirect a unit into the family. Room holds with no premise beyond listings without repetition.",
      "zh": "在部分可达、之外不低于任何底线的结果中，在之外某条件上高于另一结果者，在族上被一个部分可达的结果超过：另一步中某成员在那里取得更多或给得更少，本步即可把一个单位移入或改给族。余地成立，除列表无重复外不加前提。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Optimum.Above",
        "Becoming.Optimum.transfer_above",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Above.transfer",
        "Becoming.Optimum.member_below",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Above.room"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Above its floor, at every step to an optimum of every order rising with the family, each member takes its whole capacity at a condition beyond and gives nothing there, so the optimum stands at its floor or at what the rest leaves less the capacity; with no floor, every optimum stands at each condition beyond at the level before with what the rest gives, less what it takes, less the part's capacity, or at nothing.",
      "zh": "在底线之上，达到每个随族升高之序的最优的每一步，每个成员在之外条件上取其全部容量且不给予，故最优立于其底线，或立于其余者所留减去容量处；无底线时，每个最优在之外每个条件上立于先前水平加其余者所给、减其所取、减部分的容量处，或为零。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Optimum.Above.full_of_ranked",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Above.full",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Above.floor_or_full_of_ranked",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Above.floor_or_full",
        "Becoming.Optimum.above_nothing",
        "Becoming.Optimum.beyond_of_ranked",
        "Becoming.Optimum.optimum_beyond"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Where no member may take from a condition beyond, every optimum leaves it where the rest leaves it; an optimum lowers it below that exactly where the part has some capacity there and the rest leaves something there; on a web, a dependence beyond met at the step is broken exactly where its need exceeds what the rest leaves less the capacity.",
      "zh": "没有成员可从之外某条件取时，每个最优把它留在其余者所留之处；最优使它低于此处，恰当部分在那里有容量且其余者在那里留有东西；在依存网上，该步被满足的之外依存被打断，恰当其需要超过其余者所留减去容量。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Optimum.optimum_untouched",
        "Becoming.Optimum.optimum_lowers_iff",
        "Becoming.sub_lt_self_iff",
        "Becoming.Web.optimum_broken_iff_capacity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Witness on Diversion: a taker with capacity k at the source and none at the store draws k from the source into the store; for k at most two this is an optimum of the store's order among the outcomes open to it, and the dweller's dependence on the source at need two breaks exactly where k is positive.",
      "zh": "Diversion 上的见证：在源有容量 k、在库无容量的取者，把 k 从源取入库；k 至多为二时，这是库的序在其可达结果中的最优，居住者以需要二对源的依存恰在 k 为正时被打断。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.takerPart",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.takerCap",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.drawing",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.before",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.drawnTo",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.drawnLevel",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.formations_distinct",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.store_source_distinct",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.drawing_within",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.drawing_optimum",
        "Becoming.Optimum.Drain.drawing_broken_iff"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "en": "No axiom. One step; the part (a Boolean on formations) and its members' capacities; the family and the beyond listed apart without repetition, the family holding a condition; the formations taking part listed without repetition, those outside the part exchanging as they do; a member may give what it takes to any listed condition; for breaks, each condition beyond met at its need at the step; decidable equality.",
      "zh": "不加公理。一步；部分（构成上的布尔值）与每个成员在每个条件上的容量；族与之外分开列出且无重复，族含一个条件；参与的构成列出无重复；部分之外的构成照常交换；成员可把所取给予任何所列条件；打断需之外每个条件在该步被以其满足的需要依存；构成与条件的相等可判定。"
    },
    {
      "en": "That a given optimizer's order rises with just the couplings listed, and that its part's capacities are these, are supplied; the core asserts them of no actual optimizer.",
      "zh": "某个优化者的序恰随所列耦合升高、其部分的容量即此，是给定的；核心不对任何实际的优化者断言它们。"
    }
  ],
  "does_not_show": [
    {
      "en": "A course of steps: an optimizer choosing again at each step, the levels before moving with it, and a rest responding to the part (the pool laws) are not stated.",
      "zh": "一个过程：优化者每步重新选择、先前水平随之变动、其余者回应部分（池的规律），均未陈述。",
      "kind": "scope"
    },
    {
      "en": "Capacities enter as supplied amounts, as the levels before do; a member giving only to some listed conditions lies outside the outcomes stated.",
      "zh": "构成有何容量是给定的，不由构成之律导出；只能给予部分所列条件的成员不在其内。",
      "kind": "scope"
    },
    {
      "en": "That the drain is a harm, or that a smaller capacity is better: no evaluation enters.",
      "zh": "抽干是伤害、容量更小更好：没有评价进入。",
      "kind": "non-implication"
    },
    {
      "en": "Where the eligible outcomes are supplied otherwise, room can fail and the drive with it (Optimum.Drain.room_needed).",
      "zh": "可选结果另行给定时，余地可以不成立，压低随之不成立（Optimum.Drain.room_needed）。",
      "kind": "converse"
    }
  ],
