  "correspondence": {
    "en": "Zhuang and Hadfield-Menell (NeurIPS 2020) assume, for their Theorem 1, a resource constraint strictly increasing in each attribute: room, supplied. Here it is read off conservation per member with capacity, the rest exchanging as it does. Saturation at an optimum is the saturated cut of a maximum flow (Ford and Fulkerson 1956) and the binding constraints of a corner solution. Reading (the AI's): at an optimum the drain at a condition beyond is the part's capacity there or all that stands, whichever is less; what of the beyond couples into the order does not enter, what the part can take does.",
    "zh": "Zhuang 与 Hadfield-Menell（NeurIPS 2020）的定理 1 假设资源约束在每个属性上严格递增：即给定的余地。此处它从每个成员的守恒与容量读出，其余者照常交换。最优处的饱和即最大流的饱和割（Ford 与 Fulkerson 1956）与角点解的紧约束。读法（AI 的）：最优处之外某条件的抽干，是部分在那里的容量与那里所有者中较小者；之外何者耦合入序不进入，部分能取什么进入。"
  },
