  "history": [
    {
      "en": "21 October 2026: added (SG2), room read off one step of exchange: room among the outcomes open to a part within its capacity, every optimum beyond exactly at what the rest leaves less the capacity, untouched where no units are shared; study section 288.",
      "zh": "2026年10月21日：新增（SG2），从一步交换读出的余地：部分在其容量内可达的结果中有余地，每个最优在之外恰立于其余者所留减去容量处，不共享单位处不动；研究第 288 节。"
    },
    {
      "en": "21 October 2026, SG3: several optimizers at a mutual best response, each a part alone (record several-optimizers-drain-by-their-joint-capacity, study section 290); this record's laws and their statements are unchanged.",
      "zh": "2026年10月21日，SG3：处于相互最优回应的多个优化者，各自独为一个部分（记录 several-optimizers-drain-by-their-joint-capacity，研究第 290 节）；本记录的定律及其陈述不变。"
    },
    {
      "en": "21 October 2026, SG4: a course of re-optimizing steps against a renewal, each step read off by this record's law (record re-optimizing-above-a-renewal-ends-it, study section 291); this record's laws and their statements are unchanged.",
      "zh": "2026年10月21日，SG4：对更新的重新优化过程，每步由本记录之律读出（记录 re-optimizing-above-a-renewal-ends-it，研究第 291 节）；本记录的定律及其陈述不变。"
    },
    {
      "en": "25 October 2026, UE1b (board rule 9): Optimum.Above.full, Optimum.Above.floor_or_full and Optimum.optimum_beyond are now corollaries of Optimum.Above.full_of_ranked, Optimum.Above.floor_or_full_of_ranked and Optimum.beyond_of_ranked, which take as hypothesis that the order ranks above the optimum the outcome with one unit moved from the condition beyond into the family, in place of the rising order; the three are added to the fourth law and its references; statements and this record's laws unchanged. Optimum.lean rebound to core receipt 20261025T173410.671057Z after reading the change (record what-a-set-point-optimum-does-beyond, study section 415).",
      "zh": "2026年10月25日，UE1b（看板规则 9）：Optimum.Above.full、Optimum.Above.floor_or_full 与 Optimum.optimum_beyond 现为 Optimum.Above.full_of_ranked、Optimum.Above.floor_or_full_of_ranked 与 Optimum.beyond_of_ranked 的推论；后三者以其序把自之外该条件移入族一单位的结果排在最优之上为假设，代替升高的序；三者加入第四条定律及其引用；陈述与本记录的定律不变。读过改动后 Optimum.lean 改绑核心回执 20261025T173410.671057Z（记录 what-a-set-point-optimum-does-beyond，研究第 415 节）。"
    },
    {
      "en": "25 October 2026, board item DF (study section 418): the retired registration word in the correspondence's reading ('what the order registers of the beyond') reads in the coupling vocabulary ('what of the beyond couples into the order'); the laws are unchanged.",
      "zh": "2026年10月25日，工作板条目 DF（研究第 418 节）：对应之读法中退役的登记用语（“序对之外记录什么”）改用耦合之词（“之外何者耦合入序”）；定律不变。"
    },
    {
      "en": "6 November 2026, board item LM: declarations this record lists moved with the helpers stated once; its references follow them, and no law changed.",
      "zh": "2026年11月6日，工作板条目 LM：此记录所列之声明随只陈述一次之辅助引理而移；其引用从之，诸律不变。"
    }
  ]
